---

<section class="section guarantee-section">
  <div class="container flex-column align-center">
    <div class="guarantee-card">
      <div class="guarantee-badge-header">
        <div class="shield-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="badge-title">THE 90-DAY "ZERO-RISK" GUARANTEE</div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="guarantee-headline">
        10 QUALIFIED ESTIMATE OPPORTUNITIES IN 90 DAYS — OR WE WORK 100% FREE.
      </h2>

      <p class="guarantee-body">
        We don't sell "leads" to 5 different contractors in the same zip code. We build <strong>your custom Contractor Revenue Engine™</strong> that generates 100% exclusive homeowner inquiries directly for your business.
      </p>

      <div class="guarantee-features-grid grid-3">
        <div class="guarantee-item">
          <div class="item-number">01</div>
          <h4 class="item-title">100% EXCLUSIVE TO YOU</h4>
          <p class="item-text">Every homeowner lead goes directly to your phone and email. Zero shared competition.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guarantee-item">
          <div class="item-number">02</div>
          <h4 class="item-title">VERIFIED QUALIFIED HOMEOWNERS</h4>
          <p class="item-text">Real homeowners in your service radius looking for estimates for your exact trade service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guarantee-item">
          <div class="item-number">03</div>
          <h4 class="item-title">WE WORK FOR FREE UNTIL HIT</h4>
          <p class="item-text">If you don't receive 10 qualified lead opportunities within 90 days, we charge $0 until we hit the goal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantee-footer">
        <a href="#" data-open-lead-modal class="btn btn-neon btn-lg">TEST-DRIVE YOUR REVENUE ENGINE RISK-FREE</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guarantee-section {
    padding: 4rem 0 5.5rem 0;
  }

  .guarantee-card {
    background: #181b20;
    border: 2.5px solid #000000;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #000000;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .guarantee-badge-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(112, 224, 0, 0.15);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--neon-green);
  }

  .shield-icon svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    stroke: var(--neon-green);
  }

  .badge-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .guarantee-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-white);
    line-height: 1.25;
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .guarantee-body {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    max-width: 780px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .guarantee-features-grid {
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .guarantee-item {
    background: #242830;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .item-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--neon-green);
  }

  .item-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-white);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .item-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .guarantee-footer {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .guarantee-card {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .guarantee-headline {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .guarantee-item {
      text-align: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
</style>
